<section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Instructions and limits</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">Start with the clearest original you have. Check the preview closely: size alone does not make a blurry photo acceptable. If the result is too soft, use a better scan or a larger target if your form allows it.</p><p class="mt-2">Related: <a class="underline" href="/tools/image-to-20kb/">Image to 20 KB</a> · <a class="underline" href="/tools/signature-10-to-20kb/">Signature 10–20 KB</a> · <a class="underline" href="/application-checker/">Application checker</a></p></section>
